# Cache rules for the Cloudflare build (pnpm build:cloudflare), which Workers Static Assets reads from the build's
# root. Paths are as the UI Worker sees them: a router in front takes the base (/app) off first.
# Hashed bundles never change under one name; everything else (index.html, the SPA fallback) is checked every time.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/assets/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
